			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750150501,
					"content": "呼，總算清理完了，那、那我就要開始釣魚了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750150502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750150502,
					"content": "唔…我一定要釣到一條大魚給你們看看！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750150503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750150503,
					"content": "但可惜水面一動也不動，沒有波瀾。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750150504
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750150504,
					"content": "唔…是不是這裡的水質太好了？魚兒根本不想從裡面出來嘛！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750150505,
						750150508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750150505,
					"content": "勝利就在眼前，嘿嘿~",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750150506
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750150506,
					"content": "就是這樣，「勝利就在眼前！」…不對，現在才剛開始，離勝利還早得呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750150507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750150507,
					"content": "不要在這種時候胡亂鼓勵啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750150511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750150511,
					"content": "唔…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750150512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750150512,
					"content": "要成功了，要成功了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750150513
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750150513,
					"content": "#唉呀，{F#妳}{M#你}不要在這個時候說話啦…真是的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750150514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750150514,
					"content": "怎麼了怎麼了？哇！魚竿動了，讓我看看是什麼好東西！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750150515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750150515,
					"content": "#什麼嘛，不是魚，只是個漂流瓶，而且還用線綁在釣點的木板上…這樣一想，{NICKNAME}也常常釣到奇怪的東西。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750150516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750150516,
					"content": "釣魚的什麼都釣得到，除了魚…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750150517
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750150517,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}不是也常常釣到一些奇怪的東西嗎？畢竟是釣上來的，讓我看看裡面塞了什麼…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750150518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750150518,
					"content": "沉迷釣魚的人好可怕，難道剛才那堆亂七八糟的東西都是這兩個人留下的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750150519
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750150519,
					"content": "我們還是把這個瓶子丟回去吧，看來這就是他們互相聯絡的工具了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750150520
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750150520,
					"content": "唔…我有預感，下次鐵定可以釣到魚！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750150521
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750150521,
					"content": "魚竿猛地一沉，劇烈地抖動了起來，\\n水底下是個分量不輕的「大傢伙」，惡狠狠地咬住鉤子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750150522
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750150522,
					"content": "終於上鉤了！這次一定是大魚，給我上來——啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750150523
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750150523,
					"content": "給我上來——啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750150524
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750150524,
					"content": "呀呀！！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750150525
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750150525,
					"content": "#看到派蒙很吃力。\\n{F#妳}{M#你}和{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}一起抱住了派蒙…\\n但是，釣竿對面傳來了巨大的拉力！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_CONSEQUENT_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750150526
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750150526,
					"content": "「砰」地一聲，魚脫鉤了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_CONSEQUENT_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750150527
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750150527,
					"content": "嗚嗚！這一定是一條好大的魚，魚鉤才會脫鉤啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750150528
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750150528,
					"content": "真是氣死了…啊，牠竟然還在水面上游來游去，豈有此理！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750150529
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750150529,
					"content": "呀呀——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750150530
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750150530,
					"content": "不行不行，海裡太危險了，你游得也沒有魚快啦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750150531
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750150531,
					"content": "唔…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750150532
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750150532,
					"content": "#要是有什麼辦法抓住那條魚就好了，{NICKNAME}…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750150508,
					"content": "快了快了，沉住氣哦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750150509
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750150509,
					"content": "嗯嗯，魚兒上鉤的時機就像甜甜花裡躥出來一朵騙騙花一樣突然，完全沒辦法預測…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750150510
					],
